{"3391080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fish Market", "steam_appid": 3391080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fish Market</strong> is a first-person adventure horror game where you explore and interact with a changed world after dying at a fish market. It's infested with hostile machines and horrific human-hybrid beasts. One of these hybrids, a tall, crab-like woman, who seems strangely fixated on you. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration </strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and walk through interconnected locations in first-person, interact with the environment, and encounter a variety of creatures </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environments</strong> inspired by Japanese urban decay, frozen countrysides, and abandoned mega-structures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monsters with distinct behaviors</strong>, including human-hybrids and advanced machines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric, cinematic visuals</strong> with a focus on realism and mood.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimal UI and immersive sound design</strong> that keeps you grounded in the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a 2–3 hour experience</strong></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fish Market</strong> is a first-person adventure horror game where you explore and interact with a changed world after dying at a fish market. It's infested with hostile machines and horrific human-hybrid beasts. One of these hybrids, a tall, crab-like woman, who seems strangely fixated on you. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration </strong></p></li></u